  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nA few steps in [abort a NavigateEvent](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#abort-a-navigateevent) refer to `error`, which doesn't exist.\n\nIt looks like it got renamed to `reason` when this algorithm was extracted from [abort the ongoing navigation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#abort-the-ongoing-navigation), but a few uses were missed.\n\nI'll put together a PR in a moment.",
